 "remarks": "City Living at Its Best at Bedford Towers! Whether you're looking for a place to call home or an investment opportunity, don't miss this conveniently located 5th-floor condo at Bedford Towers. This corner unit features two generously sized bedrooms, ample closet space, off-street assigned parking, and a private living room balcony offering terrific city views. The unit needs some updating, and the price reflects the opportunity to make it your own. The HOA fee includes heat, hot water, and cooking gas. This secure-entry building features a spacious lobby, main-level laundry facilities, a private storage locker, and a dedicated on-site superintendent. Residents can also reserve a private recreation room. Enjoy easy access to restaurants, the library, the train station, I-95, and local shopping. A great opportunity for homeowners or investors seeking convenience and potential in a desirable city location!",
